{"title":"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A refrigerator is offered at sale at \\$250.00 less successive discounts of 20% and 15%. The sale price of the refrigerator is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/8/178d06435ba05914d59d1e6bcd40a855180755db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\text{35\\% less than 250.00} \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\text{65\\% of 250.00} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } \\text{77\\% of 250.00} \\qquad  \\textbf{(D) } \\text{68\\% of 250.00} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"857\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first discount takes off <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the price, so the cost of the refrigerator is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/9/989adda98e7b78f78a97a50400b57b855560e6b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8\\cdot250$\" width=\"63\" height=\"12\" />. The next discount takes off <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/a/87a8787ca8fcdf64f42e938d20fa64f63871646d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, so the cost of the refrigerator is now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/9/d29afee78665d0b741cc9962e54e2c302ab0256c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8\\cdot0.85\\cdot250=0.68\\cdot250$\" width=\"205\" height=\"12\" />. Thus, the sale price of the refrigerator is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/9/a59d4a96e9b5da261773b02a88c913f108ba7f9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{68\\% of 250.00}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"149\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME\" title=\"1953 AHSME\">1953 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1953 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1953\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1953_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1953 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"